  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A ball is dropped on to a horizontal plate from a height <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> above it. If the coefficient of restitution is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>, the total distance travelled before the ball comes to rest is</p>\r",
    "image": null
  },
